n, 
a dateline is superimposed on screen in imitation of news footage. While the è in ¬ as thwarted dream is found to be sym-pathetic, and often goes on to achieve their lost dream and be changed by triumph, the á in ¬ as case history is usually unchangeable and sometimes irredeemable, even evil. The ¢ learns a caution-ary lesson Üm—in fact we could describe ¬ as case history as ‘cautionary tale’ . 
