mood
Capturing the mood of what is to be seen ¼ screen is vital. The treatment must do justice ¯ material. The reader must be engaged on an ś level. If the sequence is an exciting chase, the description should be exciting to read. If the sequence shows a family after a death, the writing should cap-ture the mood of grief. 
